| Line | What it does |
|---|---|
| 83–85 | `sizeList` toggles the `show-list` class, which opens or closes the dropdown. |
| 87–88 | `brushSize` gets all elements with class `size`. |
| 89 | `Array.prototype.forEach.call` is needed because that collection has no `forEach` of its own. |
| 90–92 | Each bar gets a click handler. It reads the bar's inline style text, which looks like `--set-size:02px`. The prefix `--set-size:` is 11 characters long, so `substr(11, 2)` takes the next two characters, `"02"`. |
