| Line | What it does |
|---|---|
| 118–122 | `setPosition` converts the mouse position from window coordinates to canvas coordinates. It subtracts the canvas's top-left corner, found with `getBoundingClientRect()`. |
| 124–128 | `draw` runs on every mouse move. If a shape tool is active, it only draws when the left button is down and a drag has started, then returns. |
